{"id":"8b478f37907667f0","group":"67","path":"67/67-thm-interpretability-pi1.md","title":"Pi1 Consequence Characterization","display":"thm-interpretability-pi1 — Pi1 Consequence Characterization","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom","book_abbrev":"67","label":"67-thm-interpretability-pi1","aliases":["67-thm-interpretability-pi1"],"display":"thm-interpretability-pi1 — Pi1 Consequence Characterization","depends_on":["[[67-df-interpretability]]","[[67-df-arithmetical-classes]]","[[67-lem-orey-hajek]]","[[67-df-reflexive-theory]]","[[67-lem-pi1-interpretation]]"],"source_scope":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 6 与 Lemma 1，印刷页 77、81；PDF 第 88、92 页","verification_status":"source-statement-checked","source_proof_status":"已核对 Theorem 6 完整短证明与 Lemma 1 证明；保留 Orey-Hajek 的底层证明限制","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Aspects of Incompleteness Lindstrom"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"67"},{"key":"label","html":"67-thm-interpretability-pi1"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>67-thm-interpretability-pi1</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-interpretability-pi1 — Pi1 Consequence Characterization"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"f2048e5139e9d29b\" href=\"?note=f2048e5139e9d29b\" title=\"67-lem-orey-hajek\">67-lem-orey-hajek</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5c333dbc176d20e8\" href=\"?note=5c333dbc176d20e8\" title=\"67-df-reflexive-theory\">67-df-reflexive-theory</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"9dc79b4dfd8280cb\" href=\"?note=9dc79b4dfd8280cb\" title=\"67-lem-pi1-interpretation\">67-lem-pi1-interpretation</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_scope","html":"第 6 章 §1，Theorem 6 与 Lemma 1，印刷页 77、81；PDF 第 88、92 页"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-statement-checked"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"已核对 Theorem 6 完整短证明与 Lemma 1 证明；保留 Orey-Hajek 的底层证明限制"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A,B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(A,B\\subseteq\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 是一致、原始递归公理集，且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq A\\cap B\">\\(\\mathrm{PA}\\subseteq A\\cap B\\)</span>。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"851cd80e64893935\" href=\"?note=851cd80e64893935\" title=\"67-df-arithmetical-classes\">67-df-arithmetical-classes</a> 的公式类，句子量化显式与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\)</span> 相交；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\unlhd\">\\(\\unlhd\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" href=\"?note=44cd21d3d12e4d8d\" title=\"67-df-interpretability\">67-df-interpretability</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\unlhd B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(A\\vdash\\pi\\Longrightarrow B\\vdash\\pi).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\unlhd B\\ \\Longleftrightarrow\\\n\\forall\\pi\\in\\Pi_1\\cap\\mathrm{Sent}_{L_A}\\\n(A\\vdash\\pi\\Longrightarrow B\\vdash\\pi).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源 Theorem 6 右侧写作 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vdash_{\\Pi_1}B\">\\(A\\vdash_{\\Pi_1}B\\)</span>。方向不能颠倒：被解释理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span> 后果由解释理论 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 证明。</p>\n<p>来源证明已读。右到左：<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 反身，故各 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\">\\(\\mathrm{Con}_{A\\upharpoonright k}\\)</span> 在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span> 中可证；它们是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Pi_1\">\\(\\Pi_1\\)</span>，所以在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\">\\(B\\)</span> 中可证，再用 Orey–Hájek。左到右：对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\vdash\\pi\">\\(A\\vdash\\pi\\)</span>，有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q+\\pi\\unlhd B\">\\(Q+\\pi\\unlhd B\\)</span>；<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"9dc79b4dfd8280cb\" href=\"?note=9dc79b4dfd8280cb\" title=\"67-lem-pi1-interpretation\">67-lem-pi1-interpretation</a>（Lemma 1）用有限一致性转移、反身性和可证 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Sigma_1\">\\(\\Sigma_1\\)</span> 完备性推出 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"B\\vdash\\pi\">\\(B\\vdash\\pi\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>来源：Per Lindström, <em>Aspects of Incompleteness</em>，本次用户提供 PDF；第 6 章 §1，Theorem 6 与 Lemma 1，印刷页 77、81；PDF 第 88、92 页。</p>\n<p>证明核验范围：已核对 Theorem 6 完整短证明与 Lemma 1 证明；保留 Orey-Hajek 的底层证明限制。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"67-df-interpretability","status":"resolved","id":"44cd21d3d12e4d8d","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[67-df-interpretability]]","embed":false},{"target":"67-df-arithmetical-classes","status":"resolved","id":"851cd80e64893935","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","h